'''Eyeball''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2022 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2022|2022 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

==Appearance==
It resembles the appearance of the [[Default Knife]], but with a large red iris eye in the center of the blade. Surrounding the eye are faint ridges. The guard is golden, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==

* It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

